{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/qpgz650f","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"Missing assessments, unknown severity, unresolved blocker and acknowledgement-only dismissal reject without source edits. Invalid credentials and role spoofing receive HTTP 403.\n\nNative local Git receive-pack is refused by pre-receive. Missing, nonpassing or stale checks, wrong publishers, open conversations and absent approval block ordinary merge.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
