{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/jqtwrq9w","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"Head/base/policy changes and report edit, withdrawal or deletion revoke Review. Four concurrent HTTP events interrupt publication and reject stale success.\n\nMerge holds the same lock as events and updates the expected Git base. A simultaneous edit waits, then rejects against the new base. Accepted report history remains retrievable.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
