{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/4vmtcjix","slideIndex":13,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"The first library trusted supplied identity strings and double-read state. It could not enforce actual callers or protect the last merge interval.\n\nThe replacement service authenticates six role capabilities, rejects native receives and serializes the merge. Three unit groups, two integration drivers and full smoke/unit regression pass. HTTP observation counts include inspection calls, not separate tests.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
