{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/y94zu18n","slideIndex":15,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"PBI-068: accurate refreshed context and correction. PBI-069: real report and policy rejection. PBI-070: revocation and raced freshness. PBI-071: combined protected integration and recorded bypass.\n\nSeparate-role approval is a laboratory credential, not a human endorsement. GitHub, merge queue, hostile-host isolation and production identity are not claimed. No next sprint activation.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
